        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: German-speaking philosopher, Polish rabbi Hirsch Ḥarif\n- Places: present-day Belarus, Fürth\n- Works: Lebensgeschichte\n- Concepts: Orthodox Jewish parentage, Talmudical discussions\n\nFacts:\n- The German-speaking philosopher was born to Orthodox Jewish parents in what is now Belarus.\n- The philosopher highly praises the Polish rabbi in his work \"Lebensgeschichte.\"\n- The Polish rabbi was called to Fürth in 1775.\n- The Polish rabbi was commonly known as Hirsch Ḥarif because of his great keenness in Talmudical discussions.",
